  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Пакет зомби для ног и рук в Minecraft (версии 1.20)</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=http://rocketnode.com/BrCam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/pH6Rk</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/98c5844f62962ec3b5a6e6560e15e3d9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"968\" height=\"244\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Особенности:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>(Список сущностей, интегрированных в спойлер)</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Clogger</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Lurker</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Hunter</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Moonflowers</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Wheezers</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Pregnant</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Big Sucker</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Suckers</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Bidy</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Bombers</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Rod</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Spitter</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Spectres</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Wolf (0.3)</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><u>The Bruin (0.3)</u></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ordures (0.2)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Rabidus (0.4)</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- Переработали текстуру каждого зомби в моде, чтобы она соответствовала стилю TZP</p><p>- ДОПОЛНИТЕЛЬНЫЙ МОД НЕ ТРЕБУЕТСЯ (за исключением мода UNDEAD REVAMPED)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u>Рекомендации:</u></p><p><u>Лучше всего играть с <strong>Зомби-пакетом Tissou:</strong></u></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-20</a></strong></u></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrokencamerastuds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><u><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/479710/description_9b1bd023-0d20-4571-a75f-16ca1efc9b7d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"199\"></strong></u></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
